QuestGuidance.Register("en",392,{
[12513]="70060573\n1\tTalk to Ravaedron and help the chagrined artist attempt to make things right\tDetermined to make things right, Ravaedron needs your help once again.\n2\tTalk to Ravaedron outside Fernbrake Cot\tRavaedron stands outside Fernbrake Cot.\n3\tEnter Fernbrake Cot and see where the painting will be displayed\tMaddoc Stagshorn has invited you inside to see where Ravaedron's new painting will be displayed.\n4\tTalk to Maddoc Stagshorn inside Fernbrake Cot\tMaddoc Stagshorn wishes to speak with you inside his cottage.\n",
[12514]="7006A760\n1\tSearch for Lindil's spouse in \"The Brew and Bounty\" near the docks\tLindil has asked you to check \"The Brew and Bounty\" for her spouse, Tirneldir, in lower Lond Cirion near the northern lift.\n2\tTalk to Arthiel\tYou do not see Tirneldir within \"The Brew and Bounty\" in Lond Cirion. The guard sitting at the table may know where he went.\n",
[12515]="70071639\n1\tComplete 'Instance: The Lay of the Dry Land'\tMizâdi is ready to meet with her allies and plan her strategy for Idagâl. You should speak to Mizâdi at her camp near the border of An Shêru to begin the meeting.\n2\tTalk to Mizâdi\tMizâdi is ready to put her plan into motion. You should speak to Mizâdi at her camp near the border of An Shêru to begin the meeting.\n",
[12516]="7001E996\n1\tDefeat Morglok the Warg-packleader\tMorglok is at Naur-hoit, south of Mithechad. Perindúr has asked you to seek out and defeat the Warg-packleader Morglok.\n2\tTalk to Perindúr at Mithechad\tPerindúr is at Mithechad, north of Naur-hoit. You should return at once to Perindúr and let him know that Morglok has been defeated.\n",
[12517]="70062E86\n1\tMaelgun Redclaw has sworn to answer with death any who blow a challenge on the horn he left to the west of the gate to the South-guard Ruins.\t\n2\tTalk to Master Good-heart south-east of the South-guard Ruins\tMaster Good-heart is to the south-east of the entrance to the South-guard Ruins.\n3\tTalk to Melona beside the Greenway\tThe bounty hunter Melona has come up the Greenway, and stands now south-east of the South-guard Ruins.\n",
[12518]="7005949B\n1\tComplete quests in the Wildwood (total: 10)\tComplete factionless quests in the Wildwood to assist the League of the Axe.\n2\tCompleted\tAssisted the League of the Axe.\n",
[12519]="70062DDA\n1\tPick up one of the crates by the eastern road out of Herne\tThe crates that were intended for Crossway House were left along the east road out of Herne, and Edhan asked you to carry them to the storage room inside the inn.\n2\tPick up the remaining crate by the eastern road out of Herne\tThe crates that were intended for Crossway House were left along the east road out of Herne, and Edhan asked you to carry them to the storage room inside the inn.\n3\tTalk to Edhan outside Crossway House\tEdhan is just outside the back door of Crossway House.\n",
[12520]="700281C5\n1\tGather the items on the first page of the ledger\tThe items on the ledger may be found throughout Andras' homestead. The pages of the ledger detail out valuables within the homestead.\n2\tGather the items on the second page of the ledger\tThe items on the ledger may be found throughout Andras' homestead. The pages of the ledger detail out valuables within the homestead.\n3\tGather the items on the third page of the ledger\tThe items on the ledger may be found throughout Andras' homestead. The pages of the ledger detail out valuables within the homestead.\n4\tGather the items on the fourth page of the ledger\tThe items on the ledger may be found throughout Andras' homestead. The pages of the ledger detail out valuables within the homestead.\n5\tGather the items on the fifth page of the ledger\tThe items on the ledger may be found throughout Andras' homestead. The pages of the ledger detail out valuables within the homestead.\n6\tTalk to Andras in Avardin\tAndras is at Avardin, south-east of Andras' homestead. Andras is awaiting you and everything that you have collected from his homestead.\n",
[12521]="700281A0\n1\tCollect carrots (total: 6)\tCarrots can be found in the eastern fields of Cartrev Andras. The first page of the ledger indicates the carrots would be worth taking to the auction in Avardin.\n",
[12522]="700281A1\n1\tCollect tanned leather hides (total: 4)\tThe tanning shed is in the south-east section of the homestead. The second page of the ledger indicates the tanning shed should have several dried leathers that would fetch a decent price.\n",
[12523]="700281A2\n1\tCollect woven blankets (total: 4)\tThe shearing shed is in the south-west section of the homestead. The third page of the ledger says the sheep were shorn several months ago. That means there should be woven blankets near the looms.\n",
[12524]="700281C4\n1\tCollect sheep's wool (total: 4)\tThe sheep pen is in the central section of the homestead. The fourth page of the ledger identifies where the sheep pen is. Their wool should be ready for an early sheering.\n",
[12525]="700281C3\n1\tCollect chicken eggs (total: 6)\tThe chicken coops are by the main building of the homestead. The final page of the ledger speaks of the chicken coops and the amount of eggs the homestead produces daily.\n",
[12526]="700490DC\n1\tSearch rubble for lesser artifacts (total: 10)\030Complete The Wrath of Glúrugoth\030Complete Edge of The Abyss\030Complete Treasures Forgotten\tMany lesser artifacts can be found scattered across Dor Amarth. Lômazar may have additional information about Dulgabêth's loyal. You should find any lesser artifacts you can while searching for Dulgabêth's loyal.\n2\tTalk to Lômazar\tLômazar is located at the Ruins of Díngarth. You should speak with Lômazar.\n3\tTalk to Ingold\tIngold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[12527]="7004DA70\n1\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. King Thorin III has invited you to a great celebration of Durin's Folk.\n2\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have attended the celebration of Durin's Folk and should now speak to King Thorin III.\n",
[12528]="70041782\n1\tAssist Celebros\030Assist Siriel\030Assist Lorvegil\tFaltharan's family is located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should assist Faltharan's kin with their tasks.\n2\tTalk to Faltharan\tFaltharan is located at the steps to Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Faltharan.\n",
[12529]="7003A5C0\n1\tTalk to Meregyth\tMeregyth stands near the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch. Meregyth has offered to tell you the story of King Folca and his battle with the Great Boar of Everholt.\n2\tTalk to Meregyth\tMeregyth stands near the Mead Hall of Beaconwatch. You should speak with Meregyth and let her know what you thought of the tale of King Folca the Hunter and his battle with the Boar of Everholt.\n",
[12530]="7006832C\n1\tFind the island of legend\tIthurga explained that he has deduced the final location of Marâkh, Mother of Tempests. It is in an island in northern Jeb Khâtel.\n2\tClimb to the top of the peak\tYou have found a long path up a tall peak. The journey will be dangerous.\n3\tTalk to Hûrlub the Bellower\tThe giant seems to be agitated by something stuck in its eye.\n",
[12531]="7003FFD2\n1\tReclaim Fuirion's belongings from the bandits\tThe bandits who have looted Fuirion's satchel are gathered at the back of their encampment in north-west Lamedon. You should reclaim Fuirion's goods from the bandits.\n2\tRecover Fuirion's satchel\tThe bandit who looted Fuirion's satchel is at the back of their encampment in north-west Lamedon. You should reclaim Fuirion's goods from the bandit.\n3\tRead Fuirion's letter to try to understand his predicament\tYou have reclaimed Fuirion's letter from the bandit who looted it. You should read the letter to see if it sheds any light upon his strange situation.\n4\tCompleted\tFuirion's letter sheds a great deal of light on his predicament.\n",
[12532]="70049267\n1\tScout the location for spiders\tScouting locations are along the base of the Morgai in Dor Amarth. You should scout the location.\n2\tScout the location for spiders\tScouting locations are along the base of the Morgai in Dor Amarth. You should scout the location.\n3\tScout the location for spiders\tScouting locations are along the base of the Morgai in Dor Amarth. You should scout the location.\n4\tStand your ground and defeat the spider swarm\tYou should defeat the incoming spider swarm! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n5\tTalk to Ingold\tIngold can be found at the Ruins of Díngarth in Dor Amarth. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[12533]="70015816\n1\tBring an infused adamant to Mundgeirr\tMundgeirr has asked you to bring him an infused adamant with which he can help you to bestow a quality upon your weapon. Unfortunately, he does not know where to find such a stone.\n2\tTalk to Mundgeirr to travel to the Library of Steel\tMundgeirr can be found at the Dolven-view camp in Moria. Mundgeirr has bidden you to seek out the Library of Steel, but warns you that a band of Fire-orcs from the depths of Moria have taken control of the library.\n3\tBring the empowered adamant to Mundgeirr\tMundgeirr can be found at the Dolven-view camp in Moria. You should return to Mundeirr to complete the enhancement of your weapon.\n",
[12534]="7002E55B\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Hereswith\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12535]="7002E58F\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Fréamar\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12536]="7002E583\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Oseg\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12537]="7002E5AD\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Edgal\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12538]="7002E598\n1\tBring the Tokens of Hytbold to Warin\030Gather Tokens of Hytbold (quantity: see journal)\tThere is much work to do to rebuild the town of Hytbold.\n",
[12539]="70058BBA\n1\tDefeat Lieutenant Bauzmát\030Defeat Lieutenant Gádhmal\030Defeat Lieutenant Ogarbuk\tLieutenants Ogarbuk, Bauzmát, and Gádhmal can be found at Bagûd-mekhem. After learning of their arrival at Bagûd-mekhem, Órug has asked you to defeat the lieutenants of Gorgar.\n2\tTalk to Órug at Drenghól\tÓrug can be found at Drenghól in the War of Three Peaks. You have defeated lieutenants Ogarbuk, Bauzmát, and Gádhmal at Bagûd-mekhem. You should report to Órug.\n",
[12540]="70062AA5\n1\tCollect suitable branches north-west of Mossward (total: 8)\tSuitable branches for repairing the village's defences can be found north-west of Mossward, at the bases of trees.\n2\tBring the suitable branches to Merion at the east gate of Mossward\tMerion is waiting by the east gate of Mossward.\n",
[12541]="70072F00\n1\tExamine the banner outside Starkhaven\tStanding outside the entrance to Starkhaven, your eye is drawn by the great light-house to the east.\n2\tClimb the steps leading to the light-house\tFrom atop the steps that lead to the light-house you might obtain a good view of the ship-yard of Starkhaven.\n3\tLook to the south at the ships under construction\030Find a good vantage point on the south-eastern side of the light-house\tIf you walk to the south-eastern side of the light-house you will have a better place from which to look at the ship-yard.\n4\tTalk to the man with the furtive air\tA man with a furtive air watches you from the shadows.\n5\tFind Isamó somewhere near the chimneys on the western side of Starkhaven\tEngéru asked you to find his wife Isamó somewhere among the chimneys on the western side of Starkhaven and to give her his message.\n6\tTalk to Isamó in the alley\tIsamó stands in an alley between buildings on the western side of Starkhaven.\n",
[12542]="7006ABF5\n1\tSpeak with the merchant Rathâni in the Sail-haven\tKhôltekh has asked you to speak with Rathâni about a missing chest. She can be found near the market by the docks in the Sail-haven.\n2\tSearch for Khôltekh's missing chest in Deshûkh\tSearch for Khôltekh's missing chest in Deshûkh in Dil-irmíz.\n3\tReturn to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja with the missing chest\tReturn to Khôltekh in Dâr Laja, Hall of the Kindred, with the missing chest.\n",
[12543]="7006ABFD\n1\tSpeak with Khôltekh when you are ready to go\tKhôltekh has taken you into his trust, for now. He's asked you to accompany him to his house to speak more about his plans for Umbar.\n",
[12544]="7006AE9A\n1\tSpeak with Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr about Sêkhta\tSpeak with Nûru in Mekab-kuphâr in southern Khabârkhad about Sêkhta.\n2\tSpeak with Khôltekh's contact Zihârax in the Dûlkar in Dil-irmíz\tSpeak with Khôltekh's contact Zihârax in the Dûlkar, the Shadow Market in Dil-irmíz. The Dûlkar is located south-east of Mekab-kuphâr.\n3\tFind the hoodlums that took Zihârax's ring\tZihârax has asked you to get his ring back from hoodlum in the market stands to the east.\n4\tFight off the market cutthroats that have attacked you\tFight off the market cutthroats that have attacked you!\n5\tReturn to Zihârax with the ring\tReturn to Zihârax with the ring.\n",
})
